{{Culture of Iran}}
'''Persian astronomy''' or '''Iranian astronomy''' refers to the [[astronomy]] in [[History of Iran|ancient Persian history]].<ref>{{Cite web | url=https://www.iranicaonline.org/articles/astrology-and-astronomy-in-iran- | title=Welcome to Encyclopaedia Iranica }}</ref>
